<p>Ali akbar asws. Ali akbar asws.*2.</p>

<p>Nigahon ke sukoon ko qaake karbal mein chipa dekha.</p>

<p>Shabihe mustafa asws. ke qalb ko sheh ne chida dekha.</p>

<p>1. wo Akbar (asws) ho ya Abbas (asws) e Alambardaar ya Qasim(asws).</p>

<p>sabhi hai arsh ke taare sabhi qamre bani hashim.</p>

<p>sabhi ki laash ke tukde zameen par jaabaja dekha.</p>

<p>Nigahon ke sukoon ko qaake karbal mein chipa dekha.</p>

<p>
2. qushi hai baap ki sabse badi beta ho nazron mein.</p>

<p>andhera chaane lagta hai mare beta jo nazron mein.</p>

<p>pidar ki aankh thi phir bhi kaleje mein sina dekha.</p>

<p>Nigahon ke sukoon ko qaake karbal mein chipa dekha.</p>

<p>
3. Nikala yaa Ali (asws) kehkar sina tooti kaleje se.</p>

<p>yeh manzar haaye duniya mein koi bhi baap na dekhe.</p>

<p>Ali ke saath sarwar ne jo qalbe mustafa saww. dekha.</p>

<p>Nigahon ke sukoon ko qaake karbal mein chipa dekha.</p>

<p>
4. Are pushte zayeefi par jawani waah re ghurbat.</p>

<p>hui saare mere ghar ki tabahi waah re ghurbat.</p>

<p>nigahe yaas de bhayi ko apne baarahan dekha.</p>

<p>Nigahon ke sukoon ko qaake karbal mein chipa dekha.</p>

<p>
5. Wo maa'n ko yaad aata hai jawaa'n ka barchiya'n khana.</p>

<p>wo Zainab (s.a) ka barehna paou'n qaime se nikal jana.</p>

<p>Ali akbar (asws) ke sar ko jab bhi baade karbala dekha.</p>

<p>shabihe mustafa ke qalb ko sheh ne chida dekha.</p>

<p>Kalaam: Janab Syed Mohebbe Abid Abidi Sahab Qibla (Farmaan)</p>